optimized_instructions.dataflow_inspector:
Identify and list every line of code that references or touches the target column: reading, filtering, transforming, type-casting, sorting, indexing, merging, or including it in column lists (such as out_cols or export schemas).

Carefully count lines starting from line 1 of code_script. Scan for the exact target column name (both as a string literal and identifier) and verify that the target column name actually appears on the reported line numbers. Ensure line numbers precisely match the code. Use 1-based line numbers; put adjacent lines in one range.

Output only JSON: { "sources": [{ "start_line": int, "end_line": int }, ...] }

